r 10 acquaint  fate when you reach adventure rank 10.  and when you reach adventure rank 20 you  will receive a 4 star character  barbara to receive the launch awards  just create an account and use the code  in the description try it out right now  to download the pc version which i  recommend  click that link in the description  gentian impact is also available on  mobile in the app store  and google play now after a lot of  speculation  and genuine confusion about the attack  on titan season 4  air date on september 24th it was  confirmed that the final season of  attack on titan will begin airing on  december  7th of 2020. this is about two months  after a fall anime season show would  normally begin  airing but with the widespread delays  due to the current global crisis  i for one am happy that the delay wasn't  even longer  if you are an anime only fan you may be  wondering  what you are in for with the final  season of attack on titan  without spoiling anything i can tell you  that it is going to be absolutely insane  and if they adapt the manga well  attack on titan will definitely become  an undisputed  modern classic anime if you're wondering  whether you should be excited for this  season  yes yes you should so get ready because  it's going  to be absolutely epic but  if as an anime only you don't want any  spoilers from this point forward  you should click away from this video  because now we are going to get  into the attack on titan's source  material the manga  and we'll talk about how the attack on  titan series will eventually  end so if you are a manga reader like me  you know that as of this final season  release date announcement  the attack on titan manga which is the  source material for the anime  is not actually over in the past anime  series that ended before the manga came  to a proper conclusion  often chose to stray away from the manga  and create a completely different  ending to the story the original  fullmetal alchemist anime  is a f