rn  into titans aaron being defeated would  not change the fact that most of the  world is afraid of aldians as a whole  because of their abilities to turn into  titans in terms of lelouch  he was definitely responsible for the  deaths of many people  including civilians but he didn't launch  a literal global apocalypse that has  already killed  a countless number of people and leveled  nearly an entire continent  if aaron had just taken out a bunch of  military targets  or if he had launched a limited rumbling  i could have seen the lelouch scenario  happening  but after chapter 131 i don't think that  aaron can be put in the same category as  lelouch  aaron has crossed the line and short of  some sort of time travel shenanigans  i don't think that aaron can ever go  back to being a hero who is just  pretending to be a villain  aaron's desire to protect parodies might  be noble  but his actions are the very definition  of super villainy  and chapter 131 really proved it and so  if we're not going towards a code geass  type ending  how will the attack on titan manga  finally end  there are probably three reasonable  possibilities with one additional  wild card option option one is that  aaron really will destroy the whole  world  except for parodies and then after that  he might use the founding titan's power  to erase  everyone's memories of the actual  apocalypse  and this would essentially give everyone  on the island except for aaron himself  a fresh start as they would believe that  they are the only humans  left in the world and since they  wouldn't remember why  they happened to be the only humans left  they wouldn't feel guilty  about what aaron has done option 2 is  that aaron will fail to destroy the  world because the alliance of scouts and  marland warriors  will stop him this option would  definitely give us an absolutely epic  final battle but can we really expect  mikasanarman to  actually go through with killing aaron  i'd have to see it  to believe it option 3 would involve  mikasa  and or armin somehow convincing aaron to  change his mind and stop the rumbling  before the entire world is destroyed  however pulling something like this off  without it being anticlimactic  would be a huge challenge and the final  option the one that would be a total  wild card  is directly related to emir fritz if  emir fritz decides that aaron's plan  isn't the right path  after all perhaps she will use the  founding titan's power to stop him  or maybe she can even turn back time  using the attack titan's future memories  maybe the story that we are seeing right  now is just one of many  possible futures that amir fritz saw  when she made her deal with aaron  because presumably when she made her  deal with aaron emir  also got access to his future memories  so maybe amir will decide to change this  future  by altering something in the past again  though  this wild card ending would be extremely  hard to pull off because after  everything that we just experienced  in these last several chapters having  amir just turned back the clock  could be quite anticlimactic it might  feel like  it was all a dream bro type of ending  and that would be a hard pill to swallow  for the fans of attack on titan  since many of us love attack on titan  precisely because of its ruthless  realism but no matter how the story  ultimately ends  attack on titan is already a modern  classic in my mind  this story is a masterful commentary on  human nature  and the nature of war and even though a  terrible ending can definitely ruin a  series  the attack on titan journey so far has  been an amazing experience  let me know what you guys think are you  excited for season 4  and how do you think that the story is  going to end  also do you think that the anime is  going to stray away from the manga  or are we in the clear because of the  fact that the manga  is almost over hit me up with your  feedback down in the comments below  if you enjoyed this video you want to  see more attack on titan content  right here on the channel please leave a  like to let me know it really does help  and if you happen to be new to anime  uproar or maybe you just haven't  subscribed  make this the video do you subscribe and  hit that notification bell to turn on  all notifications you can also hit me up  on twitter  and instagram at anime uproar  as always thank you guys so much for  watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you


